 text += ['',f"Measured primary generation worker wall{sum(g['seconds'] for g in generation):.2f}s;replay worker wall{sum(v['seconds'] for v in validation):.2f}s. Primary generation FEM{sum(g['FEM'] for g in generation)};mandatory replay{sum(v['mandatory_FEM'] for v in validation)};FD/primitive extras{sum(v['extra_FEM'] for v in validation)}. Inclusive per-worker serialization/checkpoint/OC/state/checksum timings and filesystem journal-to-metadata publication spans are preserved; overlap prevents summing these as exclusive components. Native total{sum(g['bytes'] for g in generation)/2**20:.2f}MiB. Recovery and regression fixtures add work separately; all attempt results/partial journals remain. Projections assume observed empirical mean or501states per case, include startup/checkpoints/replay/monitoring; exact hardware/population changes remain uncertain. Monitor storage projects linearly from measured bytes/job,while parent retains compact metadata,not raw sample arrays. Parallel workers disabled.",'','## Explicit research answers','', '1. Yes: JSONL writer retains no raw sample list; compact attempt summaries only.','2. Synthetic100-worker RSS and real12-worker RSS are tabulated; observed bounds,not a theorem.','3. Reports stream summary/trace reducers; independently measured RSS/zero FEM.','4. Max family6 versus20, with unchanged164 total and explicit quota rationale.','5. Training covers two aspects,three directions/supports,four volumes,48/96.','6. Known force/sign/mirror/start/resolution relatives stay grouped.','7. Cross-partition near-neighbor candidates remain review items; broad leakage-free claims withheld.','8. Support/location/direction controls isolate declared factors;geometry absolute point position changes disclosed.','9. Yes: twelve real jobs under an immutable16total ledger;old8guard unchanged.','10. Batch must pass all resource gates; failures retained and stop closed.','11. Every saved state/transition independently reconstructed; terminal timing and native fields checked.','12. Four fault locations and completed-worker reuse passed numerical/hash comparisons.','13. Empirical/all-cap generation/replay/storage scenarios and monitor costs tabulated.','14. Separate authorization,count-guard revision,near-neighbor/split review,hardware/disk and package review before full generation.','15. Suitable as a controlled proposed design after generation/replay;not evidence of learning/acceleration or broad independent population coverage.','','**Decision A — CONDITIONAL GO.** Twelve mechanically diverse jobs and streamed monitoring/replay support a separately reviewed larger run. Conditions: explicit authorization and reviewed count/config change,near-neighbor/quotas review,unchanged gates,disk capacity,complete replay. No full dataset authorized here.','','**Decision B — CONDITIONAL GO.** More balanced training geometry/directions/supports and grouped resolution pairs support later U-Net/temporal/Transformer comparisons after actual generation. Conditions: settle flagged near-neighbor comparisons,train-only normalization,matched data/compute/fresh-FEM costs and mechanical held-out rollouts. No optimum labels or acceleration claims.','','**Decision C — CONDITIONAL GO for a separately authorized single-state investigation.** Measured96 work motivates192 measurement,but the present1024MiB worker envelope is not justified at192. Prior unvalidated process scenarios≈2.4–4.9GiB require a reviewed OS-limited resource envelope with actual native factor/time/residual measurement and pre-OOM stop; no192 trajectory readiness inferred.','',f"Focused/full logs exit0: {tests['focused']['stdout'].strip()} / {tests['full']['stdout'].strip()}. Final protected/source audit in final_validation.json. Source snapshots precede numerical work. README and REPRODUCE.md contain exact commands."]
 name='M3_4B_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT.md' if not (out/'M3_4B_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT.md').exists() else 'M3_4B_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT_'+str(time.time_ns())+'.md';target=out/name;target.write_text('\n'.join(text)+'\n')
